Load Link Store Conditional

PowerPC[1] and ARM[2] both use this instead of CAS. The advantage being for algorithms trying 
to implement CAS loops, CAS can suffer from the ABA problem this will not. Well its not 
entirely true because CAS success can internally bump up an invisible refcnt on the 
pointer but that will eventually wrap.

Progress properties of LL/SC so far sound horrible. You can abort LL by taking unrelated
processor interrupts. Its not clear to me how even in the event of non competition 
this can complete.


[1] ldrex / strex : Implemented using a single per core Monitor.

[2] lwarx / stwcx : Implemented using a single per core Reservation. Monitors / Reservations
    	            are fundamentally similar. Each core stores information if its got
		    an outstanding LL and its address. Another LL/ interrupt / clrex (ARM)
		    or a coherence events from relevant observers can clear this state.



